# Root hygiene

Root may only contain these **files**:

- `package.json`
- `README.md`
- `AGENTS.md`
- `.gitignore`
- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`
- `pnpm-lock.yaml`
- `turbo.json`

Root may only contain these **directories**:

- `apps/`
- `packages/`
- `docs/`
- `plans/`
- `.cursor/`
- `.git/`
- `node_modules/` (gitignored)

## Forbidden

- Extra markdown/config at root (`GUIDE.md`, `tsconfig.json`, `.env*`, etc.)
- Putting ADRs or guides at root — use `docs/GUIDE.md` and `docs/adr/`
- Putting undated plans at root — use `plans/YYYY-MM-DD_HHmmss-slug.plan.md` only

App env examples belong under the app (e.g. `apps/home/.env.example`).

## Plans

- Accumulate under `plans/` with datetime filenames; do not overwrite history.
- See `.cursor/rules/plan-first.mdc` and `plans/README.md`.
